# Pressed content color

Do not invent rest/pressed `content-1` / `content-2` ternaries per control.

## Helpers

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Text or icon tint that dims or brightens on press | `interactiveContentColor(pressed, 'dim' \| 'brighten')` from `src/theme/interactiveContentColor.ts` |
| Icon-only tint that dims on press | `pressedIconColor(active)` from `src/components/icons/pressedIconColor.ts` |
| Inject tint into a single icon child | `cloneIconWithColor(children, color)` |

## Shift meanings

| Shift | Resting | Pressed | Examples |
|-------|---------|---------|----------|
| `dim` | `content-1` | `content-2` | `SecondaryButton`, `IconButton`, `IconLink` |
| `brighten` | `content-2` | `content-1` | `OptionsMenuDropdown` items |

Contract tests: `__tests__/theme/interactive-content-color.test.ts`, `__tests__/components/pressed-icon-color.test.ts`.
